<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Best Free MP3 Converters Online</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Online MP3 converters let you extract audio from videos without installing software. They are useful for saving podcasts, lectures, royalty-free music, and audio you own. This guide compares features and explains how to use a free MP3 converter safely.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">What to look for in a free MP3 converter</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>No software installation:</strong> Browser-based tools work on any device.</li>
        <li><strong>Multiple bitrates:</strong> Choose between 128, 192, 256, or 320 kbps.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> The tool should not store your files after conversion.</li>
        <li><strong>Format support:</strong> MP3, M4A, WAV, and sometimes FLAC options.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast processing:</strong> Quick extraction without long queues.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">How to convert a video to MP3 online</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Copy the URL of the video you want to convert.</li>
        <li>Visit a trusted converter such as <a href="/mp3" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline"><%= siteTitle %> MP3 Downloader</a>.</li>
        <li>Paste the URL and click <strong>Get Video</strong>.</li>
        <li>Select an audio-only format like MP3, M4A, or WAV.</li>
        <li>Click to download the converted audio file.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Common bitrates and when to use them</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>128 kbps:</strong> Small file, good for speech and podcasts.</li>
        <li><strong>192–256 kbps:</strong> Balanced quality and size for music.</li>
        <li><strong>320 kbps:</strong> Highest MP3 quality, larger file.</li>
        <li><strong>WAV/FLAC:</strong> Lossless formats for editing or archiving.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Legal and safety tips</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Only convert content you created or have permission to use. Avoid converters that force downloads of extra software or ask for unnecessary permissions. Read the site's privacy policy to make sure your files are not kept.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Are free MP3 converters safe?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Reputable ones that do not require downloads or suspicious permissions are generally safe. Avoid sites with excessive pop-ups.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Can I convert long videos?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Yes, but very long videos may take more time and storage space.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Will the quality be the same?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">MP3 is a compressed format, so some data is lost. Higher bitrates keep more quality.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
